#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "职业"
msgstr "Occupation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "幽兰草军事学园的实际经营者。虽然只是高中生的年纪，却是个具有强大行动力的创业型的天才少年。在响应联合政府的号召下，积极行动寻找各路资源与人脉，成功创办了这所新建能够独立运营的"军事学园"。目前在三蹦哥的经营下，幽兰草军事学园仍在积极招募新的学员和导师当中，努力接单承接处理社会事件的特殊任务与行动，并寻求与大型机构的合作以及获取更多赞助者的支持。"
msgstr "The actual operator of the Youlancao Military Academy. Though only high school age, he is a genius entrepreneurial youth with powerful execution capability. In response to the united government's call, he actively sought various resources and connections, successfully founding this newly built independently-operating \"military academy.\" Currently under Brother Sanbeng's management, the Youlancao Military Academy is still actively recruiting new cadets and instructors, working to take on special missions and operations handling social events, and seeking cooperation with major institutions as well as gaining support from more sponsors."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "外貌"
msgstr "Appearance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "脸型与五官帅气有形，有神气的大眼睛却遮掩在全框带有颜色的眼镜下让人不能看清。个头不高但总是很有精神地挺直着腰板。经常运动的身板也很结实。"
msgstr "Handome face with well-defined features, spirited big eyes hidden behind full-rim tinted glasses so people can't see them clearly. Not tall but always standing spiritedly straight. Athletic build from regular exercise."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "头发"
msgstr "Hair"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/sunborn.md:6
msgid "比较随性的背头（不剃掉两侧头发都往后梳，脑门可保留一两缕刘海，参见re从零开始异世界生活486和贝蒂抽烟图）"
msgstr "Casual slicked-back style (not shaving the sides, combing all hair back, forehead can retain one or two strands of bangs, see Re:Zero's Subaru and Betty smoking illustration for reference)"

